        <div class="row g-2">
            <div class="col-lg-7">
                <div class="na-kart"><div class="na-kart-b"><span><i class="fas fa-triangle-exclamation me-1"></i>İbraz Riski Listesi</span><span class="not">Teslim edilmemiş akreditif ibrazları · kalan güne göre · geç ibraz edilenler</span></div><div class="na-kart-g p-0"><div class="table-responsive" style="max-height:300px"><table class="na-tablo" id="ibRisk" data-dinamik="kapali"><thead><tr><th>Gönderim No</th><th>Müşteri</th><th>Akreditif No</th><th>Amir Banka</th><th>İbraz Son</th><th class="s">Kalan Gün</th><th>Risk</th><th>Kargo · Takip No</th><th>Durum</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div></div></div>
                <div class="na-kart"><div class="na-kart-b"><span><i class="fas fa-table-cells me-1"></i>Şirket × Amaç</span><span class="not">Filtreye göre · gönderim adedi ve masraf (TL)</span></div><div class="na-kart-g p-0"><div class="table-responsive"><table class="na-tablo ib-matris" id="ibMatris" data-dinamik="kapali"><thead><tr><th>İhracatçı Şirket</th><th class="s">Akreditif İbrazı</th><th class="s">Vesaik Tahsili</th><th class="s">Müşteri / Forwarder</th><th class="s">Tasdik / Onay</th><th class="s">Toplam</th><th class="s">Belge</th><th class="s">Masraf</th><th class="s">Geç İbraz</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div></div></div>
                <div class="na-kart"><div class="na-kart-b"><span><i class="fas fa-calendar-days me-1"></i>Ay × Gönderim</span><span class="not">Filtreye göre · kargoya veriliş ayına göre</span></div><div class="na-kart-g p-0"><div class="table-responsive"><table class="na-tablo ib-matris" id="ibAyMatris" data-dinamik="kapali"><thead><tr><th>Ay</th><th class="s">Gönderim</th><th class="s">Akreditif İbrazı</th><th class="s">Belge</th><th class="s">Masraf</th><th class="s">Teslim Edildi</th><th class="s">Süresinde İbraz</th><th class="s">Geç İbraz</th><th class="s">Ort. Teslim (Gün)</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody></table></div></div></div>
            </div>
